# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TEMPLATE - copy this file to  lc_cookies.txt  and paste YOUR OWN values.
# Fields are separated by a real TAB character.
#
# How to get the values:
#   1. Log in to https://leetcode.com in a browser ON THIS SAME MACHINE.
#   2. F12 -> Application (Chrome) / Storage (Firefox) -> Cookies -> https://leetcode.com
#   3. Find row LEETCODE_SESSION -> copy its VALUE (opaque ~800-char token, NOT eyJ...)
#   4. Find row csrftoken -> copy its VALUE
#   5. Replace the placeholders below, save as lc_cookies.txt
#
# IMPORTANT: LEETCODE_SESSION is NOT a JWT. The eyJ... JWT you see in localStorage
# or document.cookie is the auth token, not the session cookie. Copy the cookie
# value from the Application -> Cookies grid.
#
# Tip: run "node get_cookie.js" to auto-extract cookies from a browser you log in to.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.leetcode.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	LEETCODE_SESSION	PASTE_YOUR_SESSION_TOKEN_HERE
.leetcode.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	csrftoken	PASTE_YOUR_CSRFTOKEN_HERE